---
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';import {contact} from '../../lib/ask/content';
---
<aside class="ask-contact" id="ask-next-step" aria-label="Talk with Pinnacle"><div class="ask-wrap ask-contact-inner"><div><p class="ask-eyebrow">YOUR NEXT STEP, WITH CLARITY</p><h2>Let’s talk about what matters for your child.</h2><p>Tell us what you are noticing. We can help you understand the relevant service, a nearby centre and what to expect from a first visit.</p><p class="ask-small">Telephone guidance is free. Confirm services, professional availability, appointments and fees with the team.</p></div><div class="ask-contact-actions"><a class="ask-button" href={contact.tel} data-cta="ask-call"><Icon name="phone"/>Call {contact.phone}</a><a class="ask-button ask-button-outline" href={contact.enrol}>Arrange a first visit →</a><a href={contact.centres}>Find a Pinnacle centre →</a></div></div></aside>
